; M1e S1e.2.1 — `CO-H2` route 4 of 4, and the fourth route the finding did not
; name: `:as`.
;
; The stage that fixed `CO-H2` was told to "check as you go whether any *other*
; declarator route exists — the finding names three, and the loader is where a
; fourth would hide". It was here: `:as` takes the same `qualify()` path as a
; plain `(import mod)` with a different prefix, so it had the same hole, and a
; fixture set covering only the three named routes would have left it unpinned.
(import reserved_open_direct :as m)
